.860">take </span><span begin="00:44.860" end="00:45.580">maybe </span><span begin="00:45.580" end="00:45.820">I'll </span><span begin="00:45.820" end="00:46.660">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.020" end="00:48.160"><span begin="00:47.020" end="00:47.500">Heaven </span><span begin="00:47.500" end="00:47.800">can </span><span begin="00:47.800" end="00:48.160">wait</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.840" end="00:54.280"><span begin="00:52.840" end="00:53.140">You're </span><span begin="00:53.140" end="00:54.280">beautiful</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.910" end="00:58.480"><span begin="00:54.910" end="00:55.180">Each </span><span begin="00:55.180" end="00:55.630">moment </span><span begin="00:55.630" end="00:55.990">spent </span><span begin="00:55.990" end="00:56.170">with </span><span begin="00:56.170" end="00:56.500">you </span><span begin="00:56.500" end="00:56.620">is </span><span begin="00:56.620" end="00:57.220">simply </span><span begin="00:57.220" end="00:58.480">wonderful</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.990" end="01:03.010"><span begin="00:58.990" end="00:59.200">This </span><span begin="00:59.200" end="00:59.590">love </span><span begin="00:59.590" end="00:59.680">I </span><span begin="00:59.680" end="00:59.980">have </span><span begin="00:59.980" end="01:00.190">for </span><span begin="01:00.190" end="01:00.550">you </span><span begin="01:00.550" end="01:00.910">girl </span><span begin="01:00.910" end="01:01.120">it's </span><span begin="01:01.120" end="01:03.010">incredible</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.010" end="01:07.060"><span begin="01:03.010" end="01:03.160">And </span><span begin="01:03.160" end="01:03.370">I </span><span begin="01:03.370" end="01:03.670">don't </span><span begin="01:03.670" end="01:04.030">know </span><span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.120">what </span><span begin="01:04.120" end="01:04.420">I'd </span><span begin="01:04.420" end="01:05.320">do </span><span begin="01:05.320" end="01:05.500">if </span><span begin="01:05.500" end="01:05.650">I </span><span begin="01:05.650" end="01:05.950">can't </span><span begin="01:05.950" end="01:06.190">be </span><span begin="01:06.190" end="01:06.430">with </span><span begin="01:06.430" end="01:07.060">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.300" end="01:11.500"><span begin="01:07.300" end="01:07.480">The </span><span begin="01:07.480" end="01:07.750">world </span><span begin="01:07.750" end="01:07.990">could </span><span begin="01:07.990" end="01:08.260">not </span><span begin="01:08.260" end="01:08.560">go </span><span begin="01:08.560" end="01:08.710">on </span><span begin="01:08.710" end="01:09.070">so </span><span begin="01:09.070" end="01:09.400">every </span><span begin="01:09.400" end="01:09.850">night </span><span begin="01:09.850" end="01:10.000">I </span><span begin="01:10.000" end="01:11.500">pray</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.530" end="01:15.310"><span begin="01:11.530" end="01:11.830">If </span><span begin="01:11.830" end="01:11.980">the </span><span begin="01:11.980" end="01:12.310">Lord </span><span begin="01:12.310" end="01:12.520">should </span><span begin="01:12.520" end="01:12.790">come </span><span begin="01:12.790" end="01:12.970">for </span><span begin="01:12.970" end="01:13.330">me </span><span begin="01:13.330" end="01:13.960">before </span><span begin="01:13.960" end="01:14.110">I </span><span begin="01:14.110" end="01:15.310">wake</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.340" end="01:21.160"><span begin="01:15.340" end="01:15.670">I </span><span begin="01:15.670" end="01:16.090">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:16.090" end="01:16.570">wanna </span><span begin="01:16.570" end="01:16.900">go </span><span begin="01:16.900" end="01:17.200">if </span><span begin="01:17.200" end="01:17.350">I </span><span begin="01:17.350" end="01:17.620">can't </span><span begin="01:17.620" end="01:17.920">see </span><span begin="01:17.920" end="01:18.070">your </span><span begin="01:18.